        75.11609649658203,
        105.3553466796875,
        509.232421875,
        117.1723403930664
      ],
      "text": "12.\tIt is recommended that TB patients who are living with HIV should receive at least the same duration of daily TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        115.06793212890625,
        446.92889404296875,
        126.88492584228516
      ],
      "text": "treatment as HIV-negative TB patients  (strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence) (17).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        138.62799072265625,
        492.1315002441406,
        150.4449920654297
      ],
      "text": "13.\tPeople living with HIV with TB and histoplasmosis coinfection should receive TB therapy according to WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        148.34051513671875,
        403.1056823730469,
        160.1575164794922
      ],
      "text": "treatment guidelines  (conditional recommendation, very low-certainty evidence) (20).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        170.53924560546875,
        309.1753845214844,
        183.72923278808594
      ],
      "text": "Integrated delivery of care for HIV-associated TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        193.160400390625,
        517.5249633789062,
        204.97740173339844
      ],
      "text": "14.\tIn settings with a high burden of HIV and TB, TB treatment may be provided for people living with HIV in HIV care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        202.873046875,
        496.2433776855469,
        214.69004821777344
      ],
      "text": "settings where a TB diagnosis has also been made  (strong recommendation, very low-certainty evidence)​ (21).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08460235595703,
        233.7010955810547,
        289.0926208496094,
        249.52908325195312
      ],
      "text": "Eligibility for TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        262.0985107421875,
        512.5183715820312,
        273.9154968261719
      ],
      "text": "15.\tAdults and adolescents living with HIV who are unlikely to have active TB should receive TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        271.81103515625,
        511.7605895996094,
        283.6280212402344
      ],
      "text": "as part of a comprehensive package of HIV care. Treatment should be given to those on antiretroviral treatment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        281.52349853515625,
        480.611572265625,
        293.3404846191406
      ],
      "text": "to pregnant women and to those who have previously been treated for TB, irrespective of the degree of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        291.23602294921875,
        518.5343017578125,
        303.0530090332031
      ],
      "text": "immunosuppression and even if LTBI testing is unavailable  (strong recommendation, high certainty in the estimates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        300.9755554199219,
        138.7747039794922,
        312.6035461425781
      ],
      "text": "of effect)​ (22).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        323.147216796875,
        433.70550537109375,
        336.33721923828125
      ],
      "text": "Algorithms to rule out TB disease prior to offering TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        347.1858215332031,
        485.56427001953125,
        359.0028076171875
      ],
      "text": "16.\tAdults and adolescents living with HIV who are screened for TB according to a clinical algorithm and who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        356.8983154296875,
        480.0777587890625,
        368.7153015136719
      ],
      "text": "report any of the symptoms of current cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats may have active TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        366.6108093261719,
        506.7828369140625,
        378.42779541015625
      ],
      "text": "should be evaluated for TB and other diseases and offered preventive treatment if active TB is excluded  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        376.350341796875,
        339.4245910644531,
        387.97833251953125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate certainty in the estimates of effect)​ (22).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        399.8834228515625,
        511.7136535644531,
        411.7004089355469
      ],
      "text": "17.\tChest radiography may be offered to people living with HIV on ART, and preventive treatment be given to those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        409.5959167480469,
        512.406494140625,
        421.41290283203125
      ],
      "text": "with no abnormal radiographic findings  (conditional recommendation, low certainty in the estimates of effect) (22).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        431.79461669921875,
        190.4754180908203,
        444.984619140625
      ],
      "text": "Testing for TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        455.8332214355469,
        518.470458984375,
        467.65020751953125
      ],
      "text": "18.\tEither the tuberculin skin test (TST) or interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) can be used to test for TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        465.5727233886719,
        328.077880859375,
        477.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "(strong recommendation, very low certainty of the evidence) (15).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        489.1058044433594,
        500.1026611328125,
        500.92279052734375
      ],
      "text": "19.\tMycobacterium tuberculosis antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) may be used to test for TB infection  (conditional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        498.8453369140625,
        358.6681823730469,
        510.47332763671875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation for the intervention, very low certainty of evidence) (15).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        521.0170288085938,
        240.6254119873047,
        534.20703125
      ],
      "text": "TB preventive treatment regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        545.0556640625,
        515.3641967773438,
        556.8726806640625
      ],
      "text": "20.\tThe following options are recommended for the treatment of LTBI regardless of HIV status: 6 or 9 months of daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        554.7681274414062,
        515.509033203125,
        566.5851440429688
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen of daily isoniazid plus",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        564.4805908203125,
        508.6748352050781,
        576.297607421875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin   A 1-month regimen of  (strong recommendation, moderate to high certainty in the estimates of effect).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        574.193115234375,
        521.9038696289062,
        586.0101318359375
      ],
      "text": "daily rifapentine plus isoniazid or 4 months of daily rifampicin alone may also be offered as alternatives  (conditional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        583.9326171875,
        364.3415832519531,
        595.5606079101562
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, low to moderate certainty in the estimates of effect) (22).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.11609649658203,
        607.4656982421875,
        508.86968994140625,
        619.28271484375
      ],
      "text": "21.\tIn settings with high TB transmission, adults and adolescents living with HIV who have an unknown or a positive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        617.17822265625,
        513.943115234375,
        628.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "LTBI test and are unlikely to have active TB disease should receive at least 36 months of daily isoniazid preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        626.8907470703125,
        503.8768615722656,
        638.707763671875
      ],
      "text": "treatment (IPT). Daily IPT for 36 months should be given whether or not the person is on ART, and irrespective",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        636.6032104492188,
        508.065185546875,
        648.4202270507812
      ],
      "text": "of the degree of immunosuppression, history of previous TB treatment and pregnancy in settings considered to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        646.3157348632812,
        508.9858703613281,
        658.1327514648438
      ],
      "text": "have a high TB transmission as defined by national authorities  (conditional recommendation, low certainty in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.28939819335938,
        656.05517578125,
        176.0579071044922,
        667.6831665039062
      ],
      "text": "estimates of effect) (22).",
